        {
          "title": "Total probability of HH",
          "body": "Multiply along each branch and add:\n\n$$P(HH) = \\tfrac15 \\cdot 1 + \\tfrac45 \\cdot \\tfrac14 = \\tfrac15 + \\tfrac15 = \\tfrac25$$",
          "scene": {
            "panels": [
              {
                "root": {
                  "id": "pick",
                  "label": "pick",
                  "children": [
