      "answer": { "value": "$P(\\text{fake} \\mid HH) = \\frac12 =$ **0.50**", "number": 0.5, "matchesKey": true },
      "shortcut": "Think in equally likely cases: each coin has 4 equally likely toss-pairs (20 cases in all). A regular coin shows HH in 1 of its 4; the fake coin shows HH in all 4. So HH happens in $4 \\times 1 + 4 = 8$ cases, 4 of them fake: $4/8 = 0.5$.",
